        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>新时代十年伟大变革的意义</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            background-color: #e0e5ec;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            padding: 40px 20px;\n            font-family: 'Kaiti', 'STKaiti', 'KaiTi_GB2312', '楷体', serif;\n        }\n        .page {\n            background-color: #fdfdfd;\n            box-shadow: 2px 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n            padding: 40px 30px;\n            max-width: 750px;\n            width: 100%;\n            border-radius: 4px;\n            color: #1a2a40;\n            font-size: 22px;\n            line-height: 1.8;\n            letter-spacing: 1.5px;\n        }\n        .title {\n            margin-left: 20px;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n            font-size: 24px;\n        }\n        .line {\n            display: block;\n            margin-bottom: 2px;\n            white-space: nowrap;\n        }\n        .indent-p {\n            margin-left: 45px;\n        }\n        .indent-point {\n            margin-left: 25px;\n        }\n        .box {\n            border: 1.5px solid #1a2a40;\n            padding: 0 4px;\n            margin-right: 2px;\n            display: inline-block;\n            line-height: 1.1;\n        }\n        .underline {\n            text-decoration: underline;\n            text-decoration-thickness: 1.5px;\n            text-underline-offset: 5px;\n            text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"page\">\n        <div class=\"line title\">新时代十年伟大变革的意义</div>\n        <div class=\"line indent-p\">新时代十年的伟大变革在党史、新中国史、改革开放史、</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">社会主义发展史、中华民族发展史上具有里程碑意义。</div>\n        <div class=\"line indent-point\"><span class=\"box\">第一</span>，<span class=\"underline\">中国共产党在革命性锻造中更加坚强有力，在坚持和</span></div>\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"underline\">发展中国特色社会主义的历史进程中始终成为坚强领</span></div>\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"underline\">导核心。</span><span class=\"box\">第二</span>，<span class=\"underline\">中国人民的前进动力更加强大，奋斗精</span></div>\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"underline\">神更加昂扬、必胜信念更加坚定，中国共产党和中国人民</span></div>\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"underline\">正信心百倍推进中华民族从站起来、富起来到强起来</span></div>\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"underline\">的伟大飞跃。</span><span class=\"box\">第三</span>，<span class=\"underline\">书写了经济快速发展和社会长期</span></div>\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"underline\">稳定两大奇迹新篇章，实现中华民族进入伟大复兴进入</span></div>\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"underline\">了不可逆转的历史进程。</span><span class=\"box\">第四</span>，<span class=\"underline\">科学社会主义在21世纪的</span></div>\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"underline\">中国焕发出新的蓬勃生机，</span>中国式现代化为人类实现</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">现代化提供了新的选择，中国共产党和中国人民为解</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">决人类面临的共同问题提供了更多更好的中国智慧、</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">中国方案、中国力量，为人类和平与发展崇高事业作出</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">新的更大的贡献。</div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
